# AttendAI — Production SaaS Implementation Plan

## Overview

**AttendAI** is an AI-powered Smart Attendance & Workforce Intelligence Platform targeting EdTech / HRTech SaaS verticals. This plan covers the complete frontend + backend architecture, database schema, API design, design system, and phased delivery roadmap.

Design inspiration: clean education dashboard aesthetic (pastel soft cards, left icon sidebar, stats widgets, activity charts) elevated to enterprise SaaS grade (Linear/Vercel/Stripe polish, dark + light mode, command palette).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Phase Scope**: This plan delivers the **complete frontend** (all pages, design system, components) and the **complete backend architecture** (Flask, Supabase schema, API contracts, S3 integration points). Facial recognition is explicitly excluded but architecture extension points are included.

> [!WARNING]
> **AWS S3**: Real S3 uploads require AWS credentials. The implementation will include the full upload architecture (presigned URLs, metadata storage in Supabase) but environment variables must be configured by the user before S3 actually works.

> [!WARNING]
> **Supabase**: You will need a Supabase project URL and anon key. The schema SQL will be generated and can be run in the Supabase SQL editor.

