### Phase 11 — Database Schema (Supabase SQL)

#### [NEW] `database/schema.sql`

Key tables:
- `organizations` — multi-tenant root
- `users` (extends auth.users)
- `roles` — role definitions
- `user_roles` — role assignments
- `departments`
- `courses` / `subjects` / `classes`
- `students` / `teachers`
- `attendance_sessions`
- `attendance` — per-student records
- `leave_requests`
- `notifications`
- `reports`
- `audit_logs`
- `workflow_logs` — n8n trigger history
- `face_profiles` — STUB for future Rekognition
- `storage_files` — S3 metadata
- `settings`

All tables: UUID PKs, `organization_id` FK, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at` (soft delete), proper indexes.

RLS policies per table for all 4 role tiers.

